    "standard": {
        "explanation": "<h3>Operating with Fractions</h3><h4>Addition & Subtraction</h4><ul><li><strong>Like Denominators:</strong> Easy! Just add/subtract the top numbers. (1/5 + 2/5 = 3/5).</li><li><strong>Unlike Denominators:</strong> Harder. You must find the <strong>LCM</strong> of the bottoms to make them the same first.</li></ul><h4>Multiplication</h4><p>multiply Top x Top and Bottom x Bottom. Simple!</p><h4>Division</h4><p>Keep, Change, Flip! 1/2 ÷ 1/4 becomes 1/2 × 4/1.</p>",
